  Item_116715_Desc = {
    Text = "A simple dreamcatcher made from vine rings and bird feathers possesses unreliable spirituality. Most of the time, it fails when used, but sometimes it can salvage fragments of broken dreams, often just quick flashes of images."
  },
  Item_116715_Name = {
    Text = "Faded Dreamcatcher"
  },
  Item_116716_Desc = {
    Text = "A dreamcatcher made from strange ancient bird bones can vividly present dreams in your mind, as if you have truly experienced those stories and met the people from those dreams. While beautiful dreams are delightful, be careful not to become addicted."
  },
  Item_116716_Name = {
    Text = "Mirage Dreamcatcher"
  },
  Item_116717_Desc = {
    Text = "A dreamcatcher adorned with deer leather and crystals, resembling the shape of an eyeball, grants it enhanced spirituality, allowing one to glimpse a blurry yet complete dream after use. Oh, those who escape reality, strive to salvage a beautiful dream."
  },
  Item_116717_Name = {
    Text = "Spirit Dreamcatcher"
  },
  Item_116762_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Unlock after obtaining the skin "Dreamy Vacation".
"Shall we go for a walk on the beach, Keeper?"]]
  },
  Item_116762_Name = {
    Text = "Ramona: Timeworn: Dreamy Vacation"
  },
  Item_116763_Desc = {
    Text = "For Ramona: Timeworn, life was a hurried, repetitive trial.\nTraining. Solving puzzles. Calculating the probabilities of a future she could steer, only to witness the beautiful things she wanted to save shatter before her eyes.\nTime and time again.\nLater, life became a lonely and endless waiting.\nIn a ruined world where hope had long since faded, she gazed into the vast, pure black night sky, longing for a call from a distant dimension.\nDay after day.\nThis was her fate. She had grown accustomed to it, had accepted it. Until—\n\"Alright Ramona, lose the serious face. Vacation mode: activated!\"\n\"Ramona, look! Lily's group is building a sandcastle. Wanna go see if they need an architect?\"\n\"Ramona, you can't do summer without ice cream. Here, I got you one.\"\n\"Ramona...\"\n\"Ramona.\"\n\"Ramona!\"\nIn the chorus of familiar calls, the summer sun scorched everything.\nShe saw the lopsided sandcastle glittering under the light, felt the sticky, melting ice cream drip over her fingers.\nThe seawater was cool, the sand was hot. The churros Murphy brought were sweet; the tonic water Ryker offered was bitter.\nIt was all so novel. A desperate want bloomed in her—to experience more, to taste more.\nAnd most of all, that person was there, right beside her. So alive. So real.\nAs if all the past destruction, the collapse, the pain and despair, were nothing but a bad dream.\n\"...\"\nOn the sun-baked beach, Ramona: Timeworn was silent. Then, slowly, surely, she smiled.\n\"Yes. We are on vacation. So, Keeper, will you walk with me? Let's feel the sea breeze.\"\nAnd meanwhile, beneath that vast, pure black night sky, she, too—wearing a tear-dampened eye mask—allowed the same smile to surface in a lucid dream from which she had unwillingly awakened.\nThis time, she finally held the beauty that had shattered countless times before.\nEven if it was only a dream."
  },
  Item_116763_Name = {
    Text = "Dreamy Vacation"
  },
  Item_116764_Desc = {
    Text = "After unlocking, completing all tasks in \"New Journey's Start\" will grant the following additional rewards"
  },
  Item_116764_Name = {
    Text = "New Journey's Start"
  },
  Item_116792_Desc = {
    Text = "\"Come on, let's have son fun~\""
  },
  Item_116792_EmojiName = {Text = "Tempt"},
  Item_116792_Name = {
    Text = "Thais-Tempt"
  },
  Item_116872_Name = {
    Text = "Erica Room Tree Person"
  },
  Item_116873_Name = {
    Text = "Lily Room Tree Person"
  },
  Item_116874_Name = {
    Text = "Horla Room Tree Person"
  },
  Item_116875_Name = {
    Text = "My Room Tree Person"
  },
  Item_116878_Desc = {
    Text = "Wheel of Destiny with the Realm Mastery attribute."
  },
  Item_116878_Name = {
    Text = "We Will Meet Again"
  },
  Item_116878_StoryDesc = {
    Text = "You and Ramona couldn't promise to meet again.\n\nAs the Gate slowly closed, the temporary farewell you'd envisioned in your hearts solidified into an inevitable eternity.\n\nSo, when she lightly hooked your little finger in those final, fleeting moments...\nit was already an unexpected and fortunate reunion.\n\n\"You haven't changed at all,\" she says.\n\nFor these words—for the faint warmth of her fingertip—you would give everything to leap across the galaxy and meet her, even across two worlds.\n\nNext year on this day, you vow with a pinky promise."
  },
  Item_117263_Desc = {
    Text = "Emotional particles drifting through an unknown dream—upon contact, one can hear the bewildered whisper of someone looking back on their journey.\nUnlocks Resonance Nodes in the Main Story \"Paradise\"."
  },
  Item_117263_Name = {
    Text = "Heart of Confusion"
  },
  Item_117843_Desc = {
    Text = "The periodic solar sunspot radiation measurements conducted by Mythag are used to eliminate the spiritual interference experienced by the Awakeners."
  },
  Item_117843_Name = {
    Text = "Radiation Monitor"
  },
  Item_117844_Desc = {
    Text = "The Mythag conducts regular lunar distance measurements to confirm the stability of the Silver within the Black pool."
  },
  Item_117844_Name = {
    Text = "Lunar Sensing"
  },
  Item_117845_Desc = {
    Text = "Mythag conducts regular tidal water level measurements to monitor changes in the richness indicators of Silver in the deep sea."
  },
  Item_117845_Name = {
    Text = "Tide Inspection"
  },
  Item_118128_Desc = {
    Text = "After recording this Posse, you can select the Posse Skill: \"Wayward Ship\".\n\nThe Apostle of the Sea kneels devoutly at the Maiden's feet, offering a kiss of fidelity—she has traveled too far on the wrong course."
  },
  Item_118128_Name = {
    Text = "Wayward Ship"
  },
  Item_118128_StoryDesc = {
    Text = "The Apostle of the Sea kneels devoutly at the Maiden's feet, offering a kiss of fidelity—she has traveled too far on the wrong course."
  },
