  },
  Item_119690_Desc = {
    Text = "Plop... plop...\nAs the finest hunter of Aram, I had long grown accustomed to various harsh environments—deserts, rainforests, swamps, even the acid-filled bellies of colossal beasts. None of it had ever caused me even the slightest tremor.\nYet, as this sticky, viscous fluid coated my skin, a shudder of profound revulsion still ran through me. It felt unholy, a foul substance no human should ever touch.\n\"My child... my good child...\"\nHad I turned into an infant? I couldn't be sure, but my body had certainly undergone some drastic change. A pair of warm hands gently lifted me and cradled me against a nurturing chest. A surge of raw, primal desire washed over me, yet it felt as warm as amniotic fluid, entirely soothing my unease.\nI struggled several times before finally managing to force my eyes open. But the terrifying sight before me made me writhe instinctively, desperately trying to burrow my whole body into the soft, full breast behind me.\nThat was a monster unlike any I had ever seen—twisted tentacles coiled around its horns, a gaping maw that split its head vertically down the middle, and greenish slime dripping steadily, endlessly. I yearned to look away, yet I found myself entranced, unable to tear my eyes from the abomination.\nThey were staring fixedly at me; I could easily read in their eyes a ravenous desire for my flesh.\nBut why... why did those frenzied eyes hold such pure anticipation?\n\"Good child... don't be afraid...\"\nMotherly, gentle words rang in my ears, accompanied by the sensation of warm hands caressing my entire body. At that moment, my heart grew calm, as if the entity behind me truly were my mother, and I was in the safest harbor.\nThough my rationality screamed that this was impossible, I still nuzzled against her affectionately as she combed through my fur... Wait—<Italic:combed through my fur?>\nThe realization struck me. I reached out to touch myself—and what I saw wasn't my scarred human hand, but a jet-black cloven hoof.\nAh... so this is it. This is my true form. This is what Mother has bestowed upon me...\nWhen I realized this, memories buried deep within my bloodline instantaneously surged before my eyes. I finally grasped my identity, my purpose—and the insatiable desire coursing through me, impossible to suppress.\n\"ROOOOAR—\"\nI couldn't wait. I leaped down from Mother's embrace, unleashing a deafening roar, and charged toward my siblings.\nI must fulfill my duty; I must carry out Mother's will.\n\"ROOOAAARRR———!!!\"\nWith my arrival, all my siblings erupted into ecstatic, frenzied howls. The sound shook heaven and earth—it was the overture to the feast.\nWe lick. We entwine. We thrust thick tentacles deep into every crevice on each other. Then we tear and bite, letting our flesh and blood mingle freely.\nWe surge outward, devouring everything in our path without distinction. We are the cursed offspring of the Mother of Raving Lust—the sole protagonists of this profane banquet.\nThere is no need to restrain our desires anymore. We have shed our fragile mortal shells. Now, we shall devour, reproduce, and unleash—without limit—the boundless, sacred hunger inherited from our Mother.\nThis feast is an offering to Her. We shall transform this world into writhing, pulsating flesh—consecrated as a gift to our Almighty Mother!\nThais stood at the heart of the orgy, listening to the world's dying screams as it was consumed.\n\"Yes... just like that,\" she murmured.\nWatching her children fully surrender to ecstasy, the loving Mother revealed her truest, most rapturous madness.\n\"Go, go! Cast off those fragile disguises—show the world your true forms!\"\nHer gauzy veils fluttered through the air with every step of her dance, revealing glimpses of honeyed skin beneath.\n\"Apostles of the Primordial! You need no one's approval! You no longer have to suppress those desires the mortal world dares not accept!\"\n\nThis is a dance that will never end. This is a banquet that will never cease.\n\"Go, turn this entire world into your brethren!\""
  },
