  },
  Item_123552_Desc = {
    Text = "\"This snowflake candy looks pretty... Huh? Who said I wanted it! But... I guess you'll be disappointed if I don't take it, right... I mean... Thank you.\""
  },
  Item_123552_Name = {
    Text = "Gingerbread Party: Caecus"
  },
  Item_123553_Desc = {
    Text = "\"Happy Silverfrost Eve, Keeper. Here's a gift for you.\""
  },
  Item_123553_EmojiName = {Text = "Prezzie!"},
  Item_123553_Name = {
    Text = "Pollux-Prezzie!"
  },
  Item_123554_Desc = {
    Text = "\"Oh dear, does it contain a gift or a bomb? Wanna take a guess?\""
  },
  Item_123554_EmojiName = {Text = "Toss"},
  Item_123554_Name = {
    Text = "Casiah-Toss"
  },
  Item_123555_Desc = {
    Text = "\"Could you spend an hour in the forest with me? I want to... smell the sweet scent of that candy house once more.\""
  },
  Item_123555_Name = {
    Text = "Gingerbread Party: Horla"
  },
  Item_123556_Desc = {
    Text = "\"I will do my best to illuminate everyone's Silverfrost Eve.\""
  },
  Item_123556_EmojiName = {Text = "Glow"},
  Item_123556_Name = {Text = "Faros-Glow"},
  Item_123557_Desc = {
    Text = "\"Tonight, we will feast on gingerbread and maple syrup to celebrate this great party!\""
  },
  Item_123557_Name = {
    Text = "Gingerbread Party: Doresain"
  },
  Item_123558_Desc = {
    Text = "\"Merry Solstice, benefactor. Ah... This hat is pressing down on my feathers...\""
  },
  Item_123558_EmojiName = {Text = "Merry Yule"},
  Item_123558_Name = {
    Text = "Castor-Merry Yule"
  },
  Item_123559_Desc = {
    Text = "A mysterious being has left this invitation in your mailbox— along with some fragrant crumbs of gingerbread. \nAfter use, you can choose an Avatar from the \"Gingerbread Party\" series that you don't own yet."
  },
  Item_123559_Name = {
    Text = "Gingerbread Party Invite"
  },
  Item_123560_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Legend has it that if you hang a clean sock on your bedpost on Silverfrost Eve, you will receive a mysterious gift on the morning of Solstice Passage. Remember, it must be a washed sock.
After use, you can choose a Traphase Emote from the "Xmas Mythag" series that you don't own yet.]]
  },
  Item_123560_Name = {
    Text = "Solstice Gift Ticket"
  },
  Item_123561_Desc = {
    Text = "\"What's that disrespectful look on your face?! How dare you look at the Divine Mother like that!\""
  },
  Item_123561_EmojiName = {Text = "Socks"},
  Item_123561_Name = {
    Text = "Murphy: Fauxborn-Socks"
  },
  Item_123638_Desc = {
    Text = [[
