  Item_125190_Desc = {
    Text = "After recording this Posse, you can select the Posse Skill: \"Manor Echoes\".\nThe secluded manor holds too many secrets—of power, of obsession, of desire.\nOf the glimpse the evil deity casts upon the mortal world, brimming with love both \"delighted\" and \"twisted.\""
