  },
  Item_129498_Name = {Text = "VIP Points"},
  Item_129499_Desc = {
    Text = [[
After recording this Posse, you can select the Posse Skill: "Year-End Sparks".
Year after year, the blossoms return unchanged;
Season after season, I long for our reunion.

This Spring Festival is so brief, so sweet, like a beautiful dream. My dear, when you stand beside your beloved, hand in hand,
gazing upon the countless fireworks lighting the sky... pray, do not forget the devotion of this humble heart.]]
  },
  Item_129499_Name = {
    Text = "Year-End Sparks"
  },
  Item_129499_StoryDesc = {
    Text = [[
Year after year, the blossoms return unchanged;
Season after season, I long for our reunion.

This Spring Festival is so brief, so sweet, like a beautiful dream. My dear, when you stand beside your beloved, hand in hand,
gazing upon the countless fireworks lighting the sky... pray, do not forget the devotion of this humble heart.]]
  },
  Item_129628_Desc = {
    Text = "Wheel of Destiny with the Keyflare Regen Level attribute."
  },
  Item_129628_Name = {
    Text = "Roses in Mud"
  },
  Item_129628_StoryDesc = {
    Text = [[
In a loop that cannot be recorded, Ramona: Timeworn steps over the flowerbed behind the clock tower.
Out of the corner of her eye, she catches sight of the rose garden, where clusters of vibrant flowers are blooming fiercely.
After a rare moment of pause, she casts aside all unnecessary thoughts and continues her journey to the final battlefield.
The mud splashes onto the crimson petals, quickly devoured by the dark D-Slime, leaving only a proud silhouette in the wind.]]
  },
