  Item_133705_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Unlocked after obtaining the outfit "Involute Reminisce".
"Have I seen you before? ...I should have, right?"]]
  },
  Item_133705_Name = {
    Text = "Nautila: Involute Reminisce"
  },
  Item_133706_Desc = {
    Text = "\"Many, many years ago, before humanity was even born, the nautilus already existed.\"\n\n\"Their shells remember the directions of ocean currents, the temperature of the seawater, the shifts between land and sea.\"\n\n\"They remember all sounds, too. Listen.\"\n\nCurious, young Nautila pressed the conch shell to her ear. Before her, waves crashed against the reefs; within the shell, the sound of the tide washed over her ear.\n\nHer eyes widened in wonder.\n\n\"Mama, if I speak to it, will it remember me when we meet again?\"\n\nThose gentle answers later dissipated with the seaside breeze, leaving the answer known to no one. Little Nautila whispered to the conch for a long, long time. Yet fearing that such a small shell couldn't store much, she thought it over and finally decided to leave only the most important words.\n\n\"Hello, conch. I will become a great adventurer and come find you again. When we meet again, I will surely remember you. So it's a promise, you must remember me too!\"\n\nAnd then...\nWhat happened after that? That was already so many years ago.\n\nNautila felt she had forgotten something important. But just as the shell remembers for the nautilus, Nautila saved her friend out of a similar instinct—as if someone had once done the same for her.\n\nAnd so, just as all adventurers eventually meet a sudden end, she sank heavily into the depths of the sea.\n\nThen she saw the nautilus nearly swallowed by the corrosive sludge. Something in Nautila began to stir.\n\nIt appeared to be the very conch shell she had released into the sea on an afternoon long ago.\n\n<Italic:\"Will it remember me when we meet again?\">\n\nBefore the agony of suffocation could arrive, before the water pressure forced the last breath of air from her lungs, Nautila reached out with all her might and pressed the shell to her ear.\n\nIt extended its soft, moist foot.\n\nNautila heard nothing at all."
  },
  Item_133706_Name = {
    Text = "Involute Reminisce"
  },
