  },
  Item_34723_Desc = {
    Text = [[
In the "The Magic of Stories" event, obtained by clearing "Script Mystery" or completing activity achievements, an item used for exchange in the "Arcane Codex Emporium". 
Inspiration is fleeting, like a shooting star streaking across the night sky. The difference is, you have a way to capture it forever.]]
  },
  Item_34723_Name = {
    Text = "Drifting Inspiration"
  },
  Item_34724_Desc = {
    Text = "Emotional particles drifting through the temporary filming location—upon contact, one can hear the contented laughter of children.\nUnlocks Resonance Nodes in the Gameplay Event \"The Magic of Stories\".\nObtained as Achievement reward in \"The Magic of Stories\" Event."
  },
  Item_34724_Name = {
    Text = "Heart of Deduction"
  },
  Item_34832_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Achievement reward in the event "The Magic of Stories".
"Mythag Awakener Management Office Advisory: Do not overfeed Lily! The Keeper is also hereby prohibited from providing snacks."]]
  },
  Item_34832_Name = {
    Text = "By the Silver Key: Lily"
  },
  Item_34832_StoryDesc = {
    Text = "Lily Gameplay Event"
  },
  Item_34858_Desc = {
    Text = "Wheel of Destiny with the Death Resistance attribute."
  },
  Item_34858_Name = {Text = "35mm Magic"},
  Item_34858_StoryDesc = {
    Text = "Francis once told Lily that stories hold magic.\n\nBack then, Francis would sit by the window with a storybook, her lab coat warmed by the early summer sun, giving off a soft, comforting scent.\n\nFrancis spoke in a gentle, unhurried voice, but the long night of surgery had drained her. Before the story could end, she drifted into sleep.\n\nLily never held it against her mother.\n\nShe felt deeply reassured watching her rest against the windowsill, her face tired yet peaceful.\n\n\nNow, film carries stories and magic where books once did, just as new reels replace old ones damaged by children's mishandling, and the laughter of new friends replaces those quiet afternoons, warm yet tinged with ache.\n\nYet those buried memories still glow, like exposed film hidden in some forgotten drawer—unseen, but never dim."
  },
  Item_34908_Desc = {
    Text = [[
What have the spores done wrong? They simply want a home.
A chrysalis and its spore neighbors.
A material used for enhancing the abilities of Caro Awakeners.]]
  },
  Item_34908_Name = {
    Text = "Spore Polymer"
  },
  Item_34909_Desc = {
