A material used for enhancing the abilities of Aequor Awakeners.]]
  },
  Item_34909_Name = {
    Text = "Uintacrinus"
  },
  Item_34910_Desc = {
    Text = [[
In some parallel universes, it possesses the power to destroy the world.
