  Item_36813_Desc = {
    Text = [[
After recording this Posse, you can select the Posse Skill:"Roaring Blood and Sand" during lineup.

The twilight is blood-like, dust and sand fly.

On the boundless dunes, a born warrior bites open his wrist without hesitation, returning his blood to the sky and earth.]]
  },
  Item_36813_Name = {
    Text = "Roaring Blood and Sand"
  },
  Item_36813_StoryDesc = {
    Text = [[
Crimson twilight, swirling sand.

Upon the boundless dunes, a warrior born without hesitation bites into his wrist, returning his blood to the sky and earth.]]
  },
  Item_36814_Desc = {
    Text = "After recording this Posse, you can select the Posse Skill: \"The Final Vow\" during lineup.\n\nThe Knight once vowed to guard those important to him with this spear. At this moment, it pierces through its master's chest, yet only to keep danger at bay—this is the Knight's final vow in action."
  },
  Item_36814_Name = {
    Text = "The Final Vow"
  },
  Item_36814_StoryDesc = {
    Text = "The knight had sworn to guard those dear to him with this lance. Now it pierces his chest, yet only to keep danger at bay—his final vow fulfilled."
  },
  Item_36815_Desc = {
    Text = "After recording this Posse, you can select the Posse Skill:\"Ephemeral Eternity\" during lineup.\n\nThe mechanical puppet rejected the promise of eternity from the reborn spirit, as the core's current burned her soul. Before she could no longer support her body, there was one last thing she had to accomplish—"
  },
  Item_36815_Name = {
    Text = "Ephemeral Eternity"
  },
  Item_36815_StoryDesc = {
    Text = "The mechanical doll rejected the newborn spirit's promise of eternity, as the core's current scorched her soul. Before her body could no longer hold, she had one last task to complete—"
  },
  Item_36847_Desc = {
    Text = [[
After recording this Posse, you can select the Posse Skill: "Bone-Chilling Embrace" during lineup.

Flesh sloughs away into the sea, bone turning to coral.
Her fiery gaze fuses you into a final, deathly embrace, etching your form into stone.
She promised to take you home.]]
  },
  Item_36847_Name = {
    Text = "Bone-Chilling Embrace"
  },
  Item_36847_StoryDesc = {
    Text = [[
Flesh dissolves into the sea, bones harden into coral. Her gaze burns; she embraces you and sculpts you.

She promises to take you home.]]
  },
  Item_36848_Desc = {
    Text = [[
After recording this Posse, you can select the Posse Skill:"Lakeside Glimpse" during lineup.

The waters of Cambrian Valley shimmer with light, crystal clear to the bottom.

The noise in the Maze fades away, and only you and the liberated Maiden enjoy this moment of tranquility.]]
  },
  Item_36848_Name = {
    Text = "Lakeside Glimpse"
  },
  Item_36848_StoryDesc = {
    Text = [[
The lake in Cambrian Valley shimmers with crystal-clear waters.

The clamor of the maze gradually fades away, leaving only you and the newly freed girl to savor this tranquil moment.]]
  },
  Item_36849_Desc = {
    Text = [[
After recording this Posse, you can select the Posse Skill:"Gateway of Retrospection" during lineup.

The Maiden has lost count of her cycles and can no longer recall the histories she altered.

This is the last chance, the final rewind. Her sword pierced Tawil's core, but she only had time to grasp that person's hand before sinking together into the Black Pool.]]
  },
  Item_36849_Name = {
    Text = "Gateway of Retrospection"
  },
  Item_36849_StoryDesc = {
    Text = [[
The girl has lost count of her cycles and can no longer recall the histories she altered.

This is the last chance, the final rewind. Her sword pierced Tawil's core, but she only had time to grasp that person's hand before sinking together into the Black Pool.]]
  },
  Item_36850_Desc = {
    Text = [[
After recording this Posse, you can select the Posse Skill:"Feast of Decay" during lineup.

The feast has reached its peak, and the queen of Cambrillian laughs, raising her glass to you from afar amidst the jubilant crowd and D-Slime.]]
  },
  Item_36850_Name = {
    Text = "Feast of Decay"
  },
  Item_36850_StoryDesc = {
    Text = "The feast has reached its peak. The queen of Cambrian laughed heartily, raising her glass to you amidst the revelry and D-Slime."
  },
  Item_36857_Desc = {
    Text = [[
After recording this Posse, you can select the Posse Skill:"Miracle's Dawn" during lineup.

The healing miracle descends upon the Church tainted by Madness, at the cost of the blood of the willing sacrifice and the immaculate benevolent.]]
  },
  Item_36857_Name = {
    Text = "Miracle's Dawn"
  },
  Item_36857_StoryDesc = {
    Text = "Miracle's Dawn descends upon the Church tainted by Madness, at the cost of the blood of the willing sacrifice and the immaculate lover."
  },
  Item_36858_Desc = {
    Text = [[
After recording this Posse, you can select the Posse Skill: "Giant's Reign" during lineup.

The way of the conqueror is to never give up, never admit defeat.

Even if the horizon has devoured the light, he will still use his brawn to uphold the unquenchable sun.]]
  },
  Item_36858_Name = {
    Text = "Giant's Reign"
  },
  Item_36858_StoryDesc = {
    Text = [[
The way of the conqueror is to never give up, to never admit defeat.

Even if the horizon has devoured the light, he will still lift the unquenchable sun with brawn.]]
  },
  Item_36859_Desc = {
    Text = [[

After recording this Posse, you can choose the Posse Skill "All of Her" during lineup.

All 24 merge into one, dissipating into starlight.

Her personality is complete through division, and her body survives through fission.

There is only one 24 in this world, and she is all of her.]]
  },
  Item_36859_Name = {Text = "All of Her"},
  Item_36859_StoryDesc = {
    Text = [[
All 24 merge into one, dissolving into starlight.

Her personality becomes whole through division, and her body endures through fission.

There is only one 24 in this world, and she embodies them all.]]
  },
  Item_36860_Desc = {
    Text = [[
After recording this Posse, you can select the Posse Skill:"Victory of Roses" during lineup.

The majestic rose has achieved her complete victory.

She has returned to the noble rose, surrounded by the crowd like a star, with only the gaze directed at you proclaiming the secret adventure experienced together in the opera house.]]
  },
  Item_36860_Name = {
    Text = "Victory of Roses"
  },
  Item_36860_StoryDesc = {
    Text = [[
The graceful rose has achieved her complete victory.

She has returned to the noble rose surrounded by the crowd like stars around the moon, with only the gaze directed at you proclaiming the secret adventure experienced with you at the opera house.]]
  },
  Item_36861_Desc = {
    Text = [[
After recording this Posse, you can select the Posse Skill:"Truth Behind Grey Mist".

A breeze lifts her long hair, and the reflection of the grey sea of fog briefly appears before vanishing into thin air. Before you stands the same elegant and composed lady. But you know, it is not an illusion.]]
  },
  Item_36861_Name = {
    Text = "Truth Behind Grey Mist"
  },
  Item_36861_StoryDesc = {
    Text = "A breeze lifts her long hair, and the reflection of the grey sea of fog briefly appears before vanishing into thin air. Before you stands the same elegant and composed her. But you know, it is not an illusion."
  },
  Item_36862_Desc = {
    Text = [[
After recording this Posse, you can select the Posse Skill: "Midsummer Vision" during lineup.

It is a fleeting, illusory dream of one night, light and soft, not captured on film, yet flowing through the memory of every photographer.]]
  },
  Item_36862_Name = {
    Text = "Midsummer Vision"
  },
  Item_36862_StoryDesc = {
    Text = "It was a fleeting, ethereal dream of a night, light and soft, not captured on film but flowing through the memory of every photographer."
  },
  Item_36863_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Touch it, and embark on a new adventure; embrace it, and sink into a dream most absurd.
A device utilized for the storage of unrefined Silver.
Used to unlock side story content such as Special Ops and Psyche Deepdive.]]
  },
  Item_36863_Name = {
    Text = "Reality Verge"
  },
  Item_36889_Desc = {
    Text = "Emotional particles drifting through Cambrian—upon contact, one can catch the scent of red wine and burning ashes.\nUnlocks Resonance Nodes in the Gameplay Event \"City in the Lake\".\nCan be obtained by completing Achievement Rewards in \"Feast of Flames\"."
  },
  Item_36889_Name = {
    Text = "Heart of Hedonism"
  },
  Item_38702_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Item used for exchanges in "Dim Vow".
Giant stone debris scattered in the winds of Isalara.
They remain still, solemnly mourning the fallen capital.]]
  },
  Item_38702_Name = {
    Text = "Spiral Ruins"
  },
  Item_38703_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Item used for exchanges in "Keeper of the Relics".
A dream made up of circles of calcium carbonate, unlocking the secrets of the Book of Isalawu for you.]]
  },
  Item_38703_Name = {Text = "Tornoceras"},
  Item_38704_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Item used for exchanges in "Spine Spike's Grip".
One of the raw materials for spine spikes. When honed with it, a spine needle can pierce the human chest and dominate everything.
Will and emotion? They are nothing more than fragile biological codes.]]
  },
  Item_38704_Name = {
    Text = "Original Tibia"
  },
  Item_39313_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Obtained through store exchange in the event "Feast of Flames." 
"Submit to me and crawl before me! Or do you wish to taste the bittersweet of having your spine drawn out again?"]]
  },
  Item_39313_Name = {
    Text = "By the Silver Key: Wanda"
  },
  Item_39313_StoryDesc = {
    Text = "Wanda Gameplay Event"
  },
  Item_39379_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Item for exchange in "Wanda's Treasure Chest".
Giant stone debris scattered in the winds of Isarawu.
They stand still, solemnly mourning the lost metropolis.
Drops at least {s1}]]
  },
