  Item_45297_Desc = {
    Text = "Wheel of Destiny with the Crit. Rate attribute."
  },
  Item_45297_Name = {
    Text = "Silver Cod's Determination"
  },
  Item_45297_StoryDesc = {
    Text = "<Bold:Silver Cod 24>\nEvery time I pass that fish and chips restaurant, I can't help but want to scream.\nWhy is it always the silver cod that suffers? We're not even real cod!\nIs it our fault that our flesh is firm and delicious?\n\n<Bold:Cat 24>\nSlurp slurp... meow, meow (indeed, indeed)!\n\n<Bold:Silver Cod 24>\nIn the Leonian Kingdom, a silver cod dies every minute to become a human meal.\nYes, as we speak, 10 silver cod have already perished.\nTen in total! Father above, do you hear their cries?\n\n<Bold:Cat 24>\nUh... meow? Meow meow, meow meow (where is it)?\n\n<Bold:Silver Cod 24>\nIt's just a metaphor, silly. You may be a bit dim, but you have a heart of gold, overcoming the base instincts and shortsightedness of a cat.\nListen, I have a plan. I need your help to make it happen...\n\n—Excerpt from \"Explosion at Big John's Fish and Chips: Case Summary Testimony B-03.\" Due to overcrowding at Bethlehem Mental Hospital, the suspect was rejected and held in Londinium Tower for 23 days before being released."
  },
  Item_45298_Desc = {
    Text = [[
After recording this Posse, you can select the Posse Skill:"Spring's Verse" when forming a lineup.

Accept this poem, a gift from Spring to the Garden.
In our desolate lives, the roses dwell in vibrant red.]]
  },
  Item_45298_Name = {
    Text = "Spring's Verse"
  },
  Item_45298_StoryDesc = {
    Text = [[
Pray, accept my poem, this offering of spring to the garden.
In our desolate lives, the roses dwell in deep red.]]
  },
  Item_45299_Desc = {
    Text = [[
After recording this Posse, you can select the Posse Skill: "Black Swan's Step"

Light steps. A sharp turn. A spin. At the crescendo of the music, she dives headlong into flames.
Burn. Burning is the only answer her dance can give.]]
  },
  Item_45299_Name = {
    Text = "Black Swan's Dance"
  },
  Item_45299_StoryDesc = {
    Text = "Light steps. A sharp turn. A spin. At the crescendo of the music, she dives headlong into flames. Burn. Burning is the only answer her dance can give."
  },
  Item_45300_Desc = {
    Text = [[
After recording this Posse, you can select the Posse Skill:"Festival of Tides" during lineup.

The High Priestess of Lemuria never expects a response from the ocean.

She dedicates everything to the ocean, which has nothing to do with the ocean.]]
  },
  Item_45300_Name = {
    Text = "Festival of Tides"
  },
  Item_45300_StoryDesc = {
    Text = [[
The High Priestess of Lemuria never expects a response from the ocean.

She offers everything to the ocean, which has nothing to do with the ocean.]]
  },
  Item_45301_Desc = {
    Text = "After recording this Posse, you can select the Posse Skill:\"Gunshot\" during lineup.\n\n\"Bang—\"\nA gunshot that split the sky pierced the heart of the mastermind behind the conspiracy.\n\nDeath is not the end of life, but the pinnacle of the puzzle's inversion."
  },
  Item_45301_Name = {
    Text = "A Gun's Cry"
  },
  Item_45301_StoryDesc = {
    Text = "Bang—\nA gunshot that splits the sky pierces the heart of the mastermind behind the conspiracy.\n\nDeath is not the end of life, but merely the peak of the puzzle's twist."
  },
  Item_45302_Desc = {
    Text = [[
After recording this Posse, you can select the Posse Skill: "The Mountains' Resolve" during lineup.

The frigid mountains of the glacier devoured valiant warriors and mad beasts, burying the remnants of their stories under pure white snow.
But after the spring of the following year, faint signs of life will inevitably cross the wind and snow. The mountains have long been prepared for their resolve.]]
  },
  Item_45302_Name = {
    Text = "The Mountains' Resolve"
  },
  Item_45302_StoryDesc = {
    Text = [[
The towering mountains of the frigid glacier devour the valiant warriors and mad beasts, covering the remnants of stories with pure white snow.
But when spring comes next year, faint signs of life will finally traverse the blizzard. The mountains have long prepared for this awakening.]]
  },
  Item_46606_Desc = {
    Text = "\nItem used for exchange in \"Ego Dissection\".\n\nNot all memories are loyal and reliable.\nLet me tell you a secret: β is a complete liar and is lying."
  },
  Item_46606_Name = {
    Text = "Memory Puzzle α"
  },
  Item_46607_Desc = {
    Text = "\nItem used for exchange in \"Ego Dissection\".\n\nThe truth: both α and β are lying.\nNow I'm risking total annihilation to tell you this @#¥%......&"
  },
  Item_46607_Name = {
    Text = "Memory Puzzle γ"
  },
  Item_46608_Desc = {
    Text = "\nItems used for exchange in the \"Ego Dissection\".\n\nAh, jealousy! You are the mother of rumors.\nI deeply regret my accusations against α. As far as I know, it is the one that lied."
  },
  Item_46608_Name = {
    Text = "Memory Puzzle β"
  },
