  Item_47304_Desc = {
    Text = "Emotional particles drifting through the Wax Museum—upon contact, one can see tears, a red ribbon, and Londinium in the mist.\nUnlocks Resonance Nodes in the Event \"Ego Dissection\", enhancing the Keeper's combat capabilities in the Gameplay Event \"Memory Code\" and Special Ops \"Serene Fission\".\nObtained by completing Achievements and purchasing in \"Ego Dissection\" Event."
  },
  Item_47304_Name = {
    Text = "Heart of Division"
  },
  Item_47519_Desc = {
    Text = "Wheel of Destiny with the Crit. DMG attribute."
  },
  Item_47519_Name = {
    Text = "Deep Sea's Call"
  },
  Item_47519_StoryDesc = {
    Text = [[
In His dream on the throne, the King heard the divine revelation:

The storms of Lemuria will subside.
The abyss of Lemuria will vanish.

With dreams as his hall and stars as his lights,
the King shall shield his kind people, and bring forth the Divine Realm.

O follower of our lord, open your heart to our lord.

In the distant sunless abyss, the great ancient soul slumbers, heeding the whispers of deities.

His will weaves like a web of stars;
in the eternal void, He waits for you to enter His dream.

The storm lies low, the waters grow still;
Earthquakes cease, the land rests in peace.

Calamities dissolve into nothing within His serene dream,
and His people remain safe beneath His protection.

May our song traverse the deep sea,
may He grant us the oracle of a world without calamity,
may He guide us towards endless peace and bliss.

Our faith abides with Him, till the stars decay, till time meets its end.]]
  },
  Item_47520_Desc = {
    Text = "Wheel of Destiny with the Death Resistance attribute."
  },
  Item_47520_Name = {
    Text = "Poetic Bygone Days"
  },
  Item_47520_StoryDesc = {
    Text = "Since her poems became popular in Cité, her friends have been even more diligent in bringing her flowers.\n\"There's no need for so many flowers, Colette. It's just too wasteful.\"\nToday's roses are piled up with those from yesterday, the day before, and the day before that. The old flowers have even started to rot due to overcrowding.\n\"How can it be wasteful? We agreed before to exchange my flowers for your poems.\"\nColette shook her head, looking at her somewhat awkwardly.\nYes, exchanging flowers for poems—that was their agreement. She could sense that something seemed to have changed, but she was unwilling to think further.\nShe continued to write poetry, day and night. Once, her poems flowed effortlessly from her pen, but now, her writing has become somewhat labored.\nThe looks on her friends' faces as they bring flowers have started to feel increasingly unfamiliar. As she gazes at the quickly decaying roses filling her room and smells their rotten scent, she genuinely feels regret and melancholy.\nBut she has never stopped her pen from moving.\n\"I will use the flowers that grow from this land to buy us clothes and food. One day, I will even buy the house up there!\"\n\"Everyone has something they were born to do. I was born to work for this garden, for that house... and you, you were born to write poetry.\"\n\"I believe in you, Horla! From today onwards, I will keep all your poems safe. In the future, I will exchange my flowers for your poems!\"\nFlowers and poetry are the promises they make to each other.\nShe will never stop her pen."
  },
  Item_47521_Desc = {
    Text = "Wheel of Destiny with the Aliemus Regen Level attribute."
  },
  Item_47521_Name = {
    Text = "Kiss of Farewell"
  },
  Item_47521_StoryDesc = {
    Text = [[
The girl, reborn from black blood, lifted the sacred blood seed of the Mother Tree amid the desert's thousand-year sandstorms.

"As long as this seed survives in the world, the tree's bloodline will not end."

Then a thousand years passed.

This seed traveled with the tree's descendants, witnessing glory and ruin, displacement and loss, dying and rising again.

Finally, as the mighty river turned into thick black blood, it completed its final inheritance.

It was a fiery and tangled kiss, filled with unfulfilled desires and unspoken parting sorrows, enveloping the new heir together with the warm heartbeat.

That agate-like color, that jade-like sheen, will outlast the black end, pulsing with life.

Then, the first seed of the new world will rise from the ground under her blessing, growing into a colossal tree that covers the sky.]]
  },
  Item_48014_Desc = {
    Text = [[
After recording this Posse, you can select the Posse Skill:"Voices in Your Head" during lineup.

The moment your hands clasped, you saw confusion and bewilderment in each other's eyes.
Fragmented melodies converge here, for you have long forgotten the past.
A silent symphony is about to be composed, for you are determined to step into the future.]]
  },
