  },
  Item_52304_Name = {
    Text = "Weekly Luminous Pack"
  },
  Item_52305_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The birth of the Sovereign slumbering in the darkest depths will distort the entire Mindsea.
The ritual designed to resist the erosion of foreign dreams will be available during the "Abyss Sacrifice" limited-time event.]]
  },
  Item_52305_Name = {
    Text = "Divine Celebration Rite"
  },
  Item_52306_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The surging tides of the deep sea strike the boundaries of consciousness.
The ritual used to resist the erosion of alien dreams is available as a limited-time offer during the "Abyss Sacrifice".]]
  },
  Item_52306_Name = {
    Text = "Tide Erosion Defense Rite"
  },
  Item_52307_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The Cataclysm in the Dreamscape also interferes with the Keeper's Luminis through spiritual resonance.
Rituals used to resist Dreamscape Corrosion will be available as a limited-time offer during the "Abyss Sacrifice".]]
  },
