  },
  Item_55471_Desc = {
    Text = [[
A mysterious box that opens only when verses are recited.
Describe the dream of flowers to it, and it will grant you a bouquet of roses.
Limited supply during the "Before Spring Withers".]]
  },
  Item_55471_Name = {
    Text = "Dream of Flowers and Poetry"
  },
  Item_55472_Desc = {
    Text = [[
A mysterious box that opens only when verses are recited.
When your imagery is just right, it will allow you to see the truth.
Limited supply during the "Before Spring Withers".]]
  },
  Item_55472_Name = {
    Text = "Dreams of Meaning and Verses"
  },
  Item_55473_Desc = {
    Text = [[
A mysterious box that opens only when verses are recited.
Describe your past to it, and it will grant you a touch of memory.
Limited supply during "Before Spring Withers".]]
  },
  Item_55473_Name = {
    Text = "Dreams of Heart and Poetry"
  },
  Item_55891_Desc = {
    Text = [[
He grants divine inspiration to those rich in spirit during a long dream: Knowledge of the taboo is a curse for the vain, while ignorance is a blessing for the foolish.
Available for a limited time during "The Sovereign's Return".]]
  },
  Item_55891_Name = {
    Text = "Weary Effigy"
  },
  Item_55892_Desc = {
    Text = [[
He grants divine inspiration to those rich in spirit during a long dream: The gods have never left behind a will; prayers and wishes are all in vain.
Available for a limited time during "The Sovereign's Return".]]
  },
  Item_55892_Name = {
    Text = "Slumber Effigy"
  },
  Item_55893_Desc = {
    Text = [[
He grants divine inspiration to those rich in spirit during a long dream: He comes from the stars, and His kingdom shall rise at last.
Available for a limited time during "The Sovereign's Return".]]
  },
  Item_55893_Name = {
    Text = "Delirium Effigy"
  },
  Item_55894_Desc = {
    Text = [[
What if I accidentally develop multiple personalities? Don't worry, Mythag has already prepared!
A good recipe to ensure the Keeper's mental and physical health is temporarily available during "Manifold Healing".]]
  },
  Item_55894_Name = {
    Text = "Acute Symptoms Treatment"
  },
  Item_55895_Desc = {
    Text = [[
What if one course of treatment has no effect? Then let's have another course! 
 A good remedy to ensure the Keeper's mental and physical health, supplied temporarily during "Manifold Healing".]]
  },
  Item_55895_Name = {
    Text = "Consolidation Treatment"
  },
  Item_55896_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Never question the All-Father, "The Elements" and your doctor's prescription.
A good recipe for ensuring the Keeper's physical and mental health, available for a limited time during "Manifold Healing".]]
  },
  Item_55896_Name = {
    Text = "Recovery Treatment"
  },
  Item_55897_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Oh, suffering souls, you shall be rewarded; the benevolent bishop will bestow blessings upon you on behalf of the All-Father.
Available for a limited time during the "Soul Shepherd: Rerun".]]
  },
  Item_55897_Name = {
    Text = "Blessing After Mass"
  },
  Item_55898_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Oh, suffering souls, never lose hope; the benevolent bishop will offer prayers to the All-Father for you.
Available for a limited time during the "Soul Shepherd: Rerun".]]
  },
  Item_55898_Name = {
    Text = "Prayers During Mass"
  },
  Item_55899_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Oh, suffering souls, there is no need to feel lost; the benevolent bishop will guide you.
Available for a limited time during the "Soul Shepherd: Rerun".]]
  },
  Item_55899_Name = {
    Text = "Guidance Before Mass"
  },
  Item_55900_Desc = {
    Text = [[
You hear countless cries across countless universes, calling your name.
You clench your fists and respond loudly.
Available for a limited time during the "Gateway of All Realms".]]
  },
  Item_55900_Name = {
    Text = "Gate of Echoes"
  },
  Item_55901_Desc = {
    Text = "The illusory Door approaches you as countless universes shatter and restart.\nThe light of the Door flickers—you know it has chosen you, and entrusted everything to you.\nAvailable for a limited time during the \"Gateway of All Realms\"."
  },
  Item_55901_Name = {
    Text = "Gate of Fate"
  },
  Item_55902_Desc = {
    Text = [[
You see countless people across countless universes, all connected to you.
Countless hands reach out, one after another, lifting you high.
Available for a limited time during the "Gateway of All Realms".]]
  },
  Item_55902_Name = {
    Text = "Gate of Illusion"
  },
  Item_55904_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The final movement of the symphony, where the theme reaches its conclusion. Please enjoy this triumphal ode filled with hope.
Available for a limited time during the "Invisible Symphony".]]
  },
  Item_55904_Name = {
    Text = "Rondo Score"
  },
  Item_55905_Desc = {
    Text = "A newly sprouted dandelion seed at the peak of Elworth—a tiny sprout emerging from the frozen soil, brimming with vibrant life.\nAvailable for a limited time during \"Til the Snow Melts\"."
  },
  Item_55905_Name = {
    Text = "Snow Mountain Dandelion Seed"
  },
  Item_55906_Desc = {
    Text = [[
A newly sprouted evergreen seed at the peak of Elworth. The resilient sapling will eventually overcome wind, frost, rain, and snow to grow into a towering giant.
Available for a limited time during "Til the Snow Melts".]]
  },
  Item_55906_Name = {
    Text = "Snow Mountain Evergreen Seed"
  },
  Item_55907_Desc = {
    Text = "A newly sprouted white flower seed at the peak of Elworth, with ice and snow as its branches and leaves—even the bitter cold cannot wither its fragrance.\nAvailable for a limited time during \"Til the Snow Melts\"."
  },
  Item_55907_Name = {
    Text = "Snow Mountain Moonlace Seed"
  },
  Item_55908_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The opening of the symphony, where the dramatic core is revealed. Please enjoy the contrasting themes as they pull against each other.
Available for a limited time during the "Invisible Symphony".]]
  },
  Item_55908_Name = {
    Text = "Sonata Score"
  },
  Item_55910_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The moment you put on the beret, the detective's gaze sharpens, and no one dares to question your professional identity.
Available during the "Detective's Handbook" limited-time period.]]
  },
  Item_55910_Name = {
    Text = "Detective Beret Outfit"
  },
  Item_55911_Desc = {
    Text = [[

Wearing a trench coat creates an aura with music playing from behind, letting the wind sway your coat and strike a stylish reasoning pose!
Available for a limited time during the "Detective's Handbook" event.]]
  },
  Item_55911_Name = {
    Text = "Detective coat outfit"
  },
  Item_55912_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Essential accessories for the stereotypical detective. Please use while in contemplation; even if empty, it's cooler than a lollipop.
Limited supply during the "Detective's Handbook" period.]]
  },
  Item_55912_Name = {
    Text = "Detective Pipe Outfit"
  },
  Item_55914_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Pain is love; when feeling the Queen's affection, remember to call out her honorable name aloud.
Available for a limited time during the "Feast of Flames".]]
  },
  Item_55914_Name = {
    Text = "The Loving Whip"
  },
  Item_55915_Desc = {
    Text = "Bow your head and prostrate yourself at the Queen's feet—you shall become the Queen's glorious seat and footstool.\nAvailable for a limited time during the \"Feast of Flames\"."
  },
  Item_55915_Name = {
    Text = "Trampled Favor"
  },
  Item_55916_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Accept the Queen's trial and demonstrate your loyalty; all you need to do is obey.
When the Queen smiles, you will be granted a glorious place by her side.
Available for a limited time during the "Feast of Flames".]]
  },
  Item_55916_Name = {
    Text = "Favored by Command"
  },
  Item_55917_Desc = {
    Text = "A growth from the mother tree resembling a pregnant woman, exuding a flourishing and boundless vitality. Listen closely—that is the call of a mother.\nAvailable for a limited time during \"Carnal Desires: Rerun\"."
  },
  Item_55917_Name = {
    Text = "Mother Tree Tumor"
  },
  Item_55918_Desc = {
    Text = "A growth from the mother tree resembling a young girl, exuding a delicate and gentle vitality. Listen closely—that is the tentative invitation of youth.\nAvailable for a limited time during \"Carnal Desires: Rerun\"."
  },
  Item_55918_Name = {
    Text = "Maiden Tree Tumor"
  },
  Item_55919_Desc = {
    Text = "A growth from the mother tree resembling an infant, exuding the vibrant energy of new life. Listen closely—that is the cry of a newborn.\nAvailable for a limited time during \"Carnal Desires: Rerun\"."
  },
  Item_55919_Name = {
    Text = "Infant Tree Tumor"
  },
  Item_55920_Desc = {
    Text = "A parasol similar to that of a certain lady's—opening it grants you the confidence of one who never bows her head.\nAvailable for a limited time during \"The Stars Are Right\"."
  },
  Item_55920_Name = {
    Text = "Lady's Parasol Pack"
  },
  Item_55921_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The playful movement following the lyrical symphony, akin to the vibrant pulse of life. Please enjoy the whimsical joy that emerges after quiet contemplation and reflection.
Available for a limited time during the "Invisible Symphony".]]
  },
  Item_55921_Name = {
    Text = "Minuet Score"
  },
  Item_55922_Desc = {
    Text = [[
An afternoon tea invitation from a certain lady. Come enjoy delicious desserts and dance with dolls and teddy bears.
Available for a limited time during "The Stars Are Right".]]
  },
  Item_55922_Name = {
    Text = "Lady's Invitation Pack"
  },
  Item_55923_Desc = {
    Text = "A dress similar to that of a certain lady's—wearing it bestows the elegance and nobility of the lady upon the wearer.\nAvailable for a limited time during \"The Stars Are Right\"."
  },
  Item_55923_Name = {
    Text = "Lady's Dress Pack"
  },
  Item_56483_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Precision gears representing the cutting-edge technology of the era can metabolize the outdated parts of the doll.
Gears used by the doll to repair its body parts, used to exchange for necessary inventory in the shop.]]
  },
  Item_56483_Name = {Text = "Doll Parts"},
  Item_56484_Desc = {
    Text = [[
A plain and unremarkable chip, bringing you a life full of ups and downs.
Used to exchange inventory in the "Lucky Club".]]
  },
  Item_56484_Name = {
    Text = "Chip of Victory"
  },
  Item_56485_Desc = {
    Text = "The primordial notes, at the place of origin, guide the entire orchestra toward the ultimate climax. Used to exchange inventory in \"Somnus Citadel\"."
  },
  Item_56485_Name = {
    Text = "Aria's Peak"
  },
  Item_56486_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The pointer turns without rest, moving forward alongside those who never return.nAt the moment of reaching the end, all Gateways shall open for you, and all melodies shall play for you. 
The precise pointer before the Ultimate Gate, used to exchange inventory in "Echo".]]
  },
  Item_56486_Name = {
    Text = "End Pointer"
  },
  Item_56487_Desc = {
    Text = [[
His consciousness still slumbers in the Abyss.
An embryo drifting in the abyss, used to exchange inventory in "Celestial Gestation".]]
  },
  Item_56487_Name = {
    Text = "Unknowing Embryo"
  },
  Item_56488_Desc = {
    Text = [[
He devours all things, insatiable.
An embryo drifting in the abyss, used to exchange inventory in "Celestial Gestation".]]
  },
  Item_56488_Name = {
    Text = "Insatiable Embryo"
  },
  Item_56489_Desc = {
    Text = [[
He is indifferent and desires nothing of this world.
An embryo drifting in the abyss, used to exchange inventory in "Celestial Gestation".]]
  },
  Item_56489_Name = {
    Text = "Desireless Embryo"
  },
  Item_56490_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Ice cloaks it in deep blue, celebrating the birth of an indomitable life.
A newly blossomed bud atop Elworth, used to exchange inventory in "Insatiable Ambition".]]
  },
  Item_56490_Name = {Text = "Frozen Bud"},
  Item_56491_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Moonlight cloaks it in silver white, celebrating the birth of an indomitable life.
A newly blossomed bud atop Elworth, used to exchange inventory in "Fury of Vengeance".]]
  },
  Item_56491_Name = {
    Text = "Silver Frost Bud"
  },
  Item_56492_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Sunlight cloaks it in golden yellow, celebrating the birth of an indomitable life.
A newly blossomed bud atop Elworth, used to exchange inventory in "Hope for Resurrection".]]
  },
  Item_56492_Name = {
    Text = "Sunlight Bud"
  },
  Item_56493_Desc = {
    Text = "Emotional particles drifting through the snows of Elworth—upon contact, one can hear the sounds of beasts biting and devouring.\nUnlocks Resonance Nodes in the Main Story \"Elworth's Returnee\"."
  },
  Item_56493_Name = {
    Text = "Heart of Devouring"
  },
  Item_56494_Desc = {
    Text = "Emotional particles drifting through the Ultimate Gate—upon contact, one can hear the whispers of every dimension and time.\nUnlocks Resonance Nodes in the Main Story \"A Long Dream's End\"."
  },
  Item_56494_Name = {
    Text = "Heart of Extremes"
  },
  Item_56495_Desc = {
    Text = "Emotional particles drifting through the Mythag campus—upon contact, one can hear countless howls and sighs resonating.\nUnlocks Resonance Nodes in the Main Story \"Last Symphony\"."
  },
  Item_56495_Name = {
    Text = "Heart of Resolve"
  },
  Item_56635_Desc = {
    Text = "Wheel of Destiny with the DMG Amplification attribute."
  },
  Item_56635_Name = {
    Text = "Til the Snow Melts"
  },
  Item_56635_StoryDesc = {
    Text = "She stood atop the peak, raising the black spike in her hand.\n\nIn the raging blizzard, she faced the mountain of madness—and the fate that had abandoned, betrayed, and crushed her.\n\nShe would win in the end;\nthe snow would melt, and she would return in a new form.\n\nThat was what she had said.\n\nElworth is a land of extreme cold, where the snow never recedes.\n\nThis is common knowledge.\n\nJust as no warrior, however strong, could challenge a transcendent being, just as no man could overcome their own fate.\n\nAnd yet, the snow on that mountain melted anyway. Didn't it?"
  },
  Item_56636_Desc = {
    Text = [[
After recording this Posse, you can select the Posse Skill: "The Gated Answer" during lineup.

The truth of all things lies beyond the Gate.
She remains silent here, bearing all inquiries, responding with silence.
The one she awaits will eventually write their own answer.]]
  },
  Item_56636_Name = {
    Text = "Answer of the Gate"
  },
  Item_56636_StoryDesc = {
    Text = [[
The Truth of all things lies beyond the Gate.
She remains silent here, bearing all the inquiries, responding with silence.
The one she awaits will eventually write their own answer.]]
  },
  Item_56637_Desc = {
    Text = "Wheel of Destiny with the Aliemus Regen Level attribute."
  },
  Item_56637_Name = {
    Text = "Shepherd's Staff"
  },
  Item_56637_StoryDesc = {
    Text = [[
Vast flocks of sheep wander over vast grasslands.
There are many, many sheep in this world, and sheep are born to be led by a shepherd.
She has always been the prophet of this world, holding the staff of Knowledge.
She has always been a good shepherd, determined to lead the flock on the right path.
She disciplines the lambs with that staff, drives away the wolves with that staff.
She raises the shepherd's staff high, for she can always foresee the road ahead.
Once she led the flock to abundant water, to fresh pasture.
Now she sees the truth of the world, so she leads the flock into the ultimate embrace.
This way; don't look back.
She smiles, waving her staff of wisdom.
So the sheep cannot see the cliff ahead.
One by one.
The sheep fall, the shepherd sings.
Follow the selfless shepherd, for she has shown you the truest path.
Do not fear, even though you walk through the valley of the shadow of death, her staff is still with you.
Until you both step into the Abyss of annihilation.
]]
  },
  Item_56638_Desc = {
    Text = [[
After recording this Posse, you can select the Posse Skill: "Symphony Fourth" during lineup.

Notes gather into a surging sea of stars, the theme dances in the grand deep space.
Close your eyes and listen. Listen to the conclusion of the universe, listen to the climax of the universe.]]
  },
  Item_56638_Name = {
    Text = "Symphony Fourth"
  },
  Item_56638_StoryDesc = {
    Text = [[
Notes gather into a surging sea of stars, the theme dances in the grand deep space.
Close your eyes and listen. Listen to the end of the universe, listen to the climax of the universe.]]
  },
  Item_56639_Desc = {
    Text = "Wheel of Destiny with the Crit. Rate attribute."
  },
  Item_56639_Name = {
    Text = "Never-Ending Performance"
  },
  Item_56639_StoryDesc = {
    Text = [[
"Not perfect enough, practice ten more times tonight. Your talent is mediocre; if you want to enter the orchestra, you must work harder, understand?"
"Yes, father."
What kind of performance can be called perfect?
His hands flew around without stopping, allowing no mistakes.
He chastised his distracting thoughts, despising his mediocrity.
Countless notes surrounded him; day after day, everything in his life revolved around music.
Fortunately, he was getting closer to a perfect performance each day, gazing at the light at the end of the road in his dreams, yet feeling as if he could never reach it.
The craving for perfection had engraved itself into his soul, yet not everyone is willing to feel this way.
"Presenting the most perfect music for His Majesty and the world, isn't that the duty of the orchestra?"
He looked at the faces that concealed dissatisfaction, as if they were scornful of his former self.
Father, the court orchestra is nothing more than that.
He cast aside the once-revered goal and stubbornly continued down the path of pursuing perfection.
He could not stop his hands to reach out to them, just as he could not halt the hand of his former self.
Each day, he was playing continuously.
Music is his life.
Aside from music, he had nothing.]]
  },
  Item_56640_Desc = {
    Text = "Wheel of Destiny with the Sigil Yield attribute."
  },
  Item_56640_Name = {
    Text = "Fate Roulette"
  },
  Item_56640_StoryDesc = {
    Text = [[
Everyone wants to defy fate but fears it.
The brave roar for battle, the cowardly whisper in submission, yet only he uncovered the secret to overcoming fate.
He constantly invites fate to gamble, urging it to deal another round.
He never feared fate, believing he would never lose.
He never questioned what was at stake, wagering everything, even his life.
With a roulette gun, he intimidated countless opponents and became Londinium's infamous gambling madman.
How lonely it is without a worthy opponent.
Until he met that man.
He defeated countless mortals and finally took a seat at fate's table.
He quickly lost everything, then regained it all with interest.
Upon being reborn as a beast, he found the gun that had fired its last bullet.
He reloaded it, pulled the trigger on himself once more.
In silence, he grinned.
He hadn't lost yet, believing that one day he would win in the end.
Even if it meant betting everything.]]
  },
  Item_56641_Desc = {
    Text = "Wheel of Destiny with the Keyflare Regen Level attribute."
  },
  Item_56641_Name = {
    Text = "Slumber Beneath the Glacier"
  },
  Item_56641_StoryDesc = {
    Text = "To await \"that moment,\" the girl slept at the bottom of the glacier.\n\nThe deep ice of Elworth froze her body, but it failed to seal away her consciousness.\n\nThat wisp of consciousness belonged to a child—and a mother.\n\nWithin the dark womb of His daughter, the god dreamed an endless dream.\n\nOver those twenty-five years, did she ever think, yearn, or hope for anything?\n\nNo one can answer these questions now.\n\nAs for the girl herself... will she open her heart to those around her?\n\nOnly time and the future will tell."
  },
  Item_56642_Desc = {
    Text = "Wheel of Destiny with the Keyflare Regen Level attribute."
  },
  Item_56642_Name = {
    Text = "Gateway of Truth"
  },
  Item_56642_StoryDesc = {
    Text = "She is the embodiment of wisdom.\n\nShe holds all the knowledge in the world—the highest aim of every scholar in Mythag.\n\nEven hearing a single word from her can bring sudden, profound enlightenment.\n\nYet she calls herself only a gatekeeper.\n\nWhat kind of gate?\n\nNo one has ever seen it, so the scholars call it \"Truth.\"\n\nShe is the gatekeeper of truth, the Athena of Mythag.\n\nTawil never denies this—nor confirms it.\n\nShe simply watches—\nwatching this place and this world with a constant, silent compassion.\n\nIf you ever see that gate, you'll find a familiar eye upon it.\n\nIts gaze is calm and eternal.\nIt pierces through time, through your very soul."
  },
  Item_56643_Desc = {
    Text = [[
After recording this Posse, you can select the Posse Skill: "Plague of Illusions" during lineup.

Do not look directly at those mad Eyes; be careful, she may have infected you.]]
  },
  Item_56643_Name = {
    Text = "Plague of Illusions"
  },
  Item_56643_StoryDesc = {
    Text = [[
The Void is a plague brought by the Hidden Truth, erasing all colors and painting everything gray.
Do not look directly into those mad Eyes; be careful, she may have already infected you.]]
  },
