  Item_61391_Desc = {
    Text = "Wheel of Destiny with the Keyflare Regen Level attribute."
  },
  Item_61391_Name = {
    Text = "Heart of Silver"
  },
  Item_61391_StoryDesc = {
    Text = [[
It was a silver-white, clear, and spotless heart.

Made of pure silver, it beat steadily inside its mechanical frame.

It had once been stained by blood, smeared by mud.

But as death's shadow fell, it returned at last to its original form.]]
  },
  Item_61941_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Moonlight cloaks it in silver white, celebrating the birth of an indomitable life.
A newly blossomed bud atop Elworth, used to exchange inventory in "Fury of Vengeance".

Drops at least {s1}]]
  },
