  Item_69851_Desc = {
    Text = "A newly sprouted dandelion seed at the peak of Elworth—a tiny sprout emerging from the frozen soil, brimming with vibrant life.\nAvailable for a limited time during \"Til the Snow Melts: Rerun\"."
  },
  Item_69851_Name = {
    Text = "Catastrophe Alert Rite"
  },
  Item_69852_Desc = {
    Text = [[
A newly sprouted evergreen seed at the peak of Elworth. The resilient sapling will eventually overcome wind, frost, rain, and snow to grow into a towering giant.
Available for a limited time during "Til the Snow Melts: Rerun".]]
  },
  Item_69852_Name = {
    Text = "Divine Celebration Rite"
  },
  Item_69853_Desc = {
    Text = "A newly sprouted white flower seed at the peak of Elworth, with ice and snow as its branches and leaves—even the bitter cold cannot wither its fragrance.\nAvailable for a limited time during \"Til the Snow Melts: Rerun\"."
  },
  Item_69853_Name = {
    Text = "Tide Erosion Defense Rite"
  },
  Item_69854_Desc = {
    Text = [[
A mysterious box that opens only when verses are recited.
Describe the dream of flowers to it, and it will grant you a bouquet of roses.
Limited supply during the "Before Spring Withers".]]
  },
  Item_69854_Name = {
    Text = "Verses of Petals"
  },
  Item_69855_Desc = {
    Text = [[
A mysterious box that opens only when verses are recited.
When your imagery is just right, it will allow you to see the truth.
Limited supply during the "Before Spring Withers".]]
  },
  Item_69855_Name = {
    Text = "Verses of Muse"
  },
  Item_69856_Desc = {
    Text = [[
A mysterious box that opens only when verses are recited.
Describe your past to it, and it will grant you a touch of memory.
Limited supply during "Before Spring Withers".]]
  },
  Item_69856_Name = {
    Text = "Verses of Love"
  },
  Item_69860_Desc = {
    Text = "A set of gears that spins on its own despite not being attached to any doll, emitting a faint, whisper-like grinding sound as you draw near."
  },
  Item_69860_Name = {
    Text = "Double Helix Doll Parts"
  },
  Item_69861_Desc = {
    Text = "A gift box sold in the Worry-Relief Shop, more exquisite than the latest goods in any department store—to be exchanged with a genuine head.\nAvailable for a limited time during \"Phantom of the Rainy Town\"."
  },
  Item_69861_Name = {
    Text = "Witch's Dealership Giftbox"
  },
  Item_69862_Desc = {
    Text = "A gift box sold in the Worry-Relief Shop, containing rare and exotic treasures from around the world—to be exchanged with a fresh, intact skull.\nAvailable for a limited time during \"Phantom of the Rainy Town\"."
  },
  Item_69862_Name = {
    Text = "Wondrous Witch Giftbox"
  },
  Item_69863_Desc = {
    Text = "A gift box sold in the Worry-Relief Shop, a secret treasure drawn from the shopkeeper's private collection and filled with wondrous items unlike anything you've ever heard of—to be exchanged with a beautiful skull worthy of collecting.\nAvailable for a limited time during \"Phantom of the Rainy Town\"."
  },
  Item_69863_Name = {
    Text = "Mysterious Witch Giftbox"
  },
  Item_69867_Desc = {
    Text = [[
An afternoon tea invitation from a certain lady. Come enjoy delicious desserts and dance with dolls and teddy bears.
Available for a limited time during "The Stars Are Right".]]
  },
  Item_69867_Name = {
    Text = "Lady's Invitation Pack"
  },
  Item_69868_Desc = {
    Text = "A dress similar to that of a certain lady's—wearing it bestows the elegance and nobility of the lady upon the wearer.\nAvailable for a limited time during \"The Stars Are Right\"."
  },
  Item_69868_Name = {
    Text = "Lady's Dress Pack"
  },
  Item_69869_Desc = {
    Text = "A parasol similar to that of a certain lady's—opening it grants you the confidence of one who never bows her head.\nAvailable for a limited time during \"The Stars Are Right\"."
  },
  Item_69869_Name = {
    Text = "Lady's Parasol Pack"
  },
  Item_69870_Desc = {
    Text = [[
A nautical chart depicting famous commercial shipping routes, guiding merchants safely to port.
Available for a limited time during "Beneath the Tempest".]]
  },
  Item_69870_Name = {
    Text = "Guidance of the Golden Route"
  },
  Item_69871_Desc = {
    Text = [[
A special prescription from Clementine's Mental Clinic, capable of suppressing long-term recurring mental disorders.
Available for a limited time during "Buried in Memory".]]
  },
  Item_69871_Name = {
    Text = "Madness Prescription"
  },
  Item_69872_Desc = {
    Text = [[
A special prescription from Clementine's Mental Clinic, capable of saving those who have permanently fallen into the abyss of madness.
Available for a limited time during "Buried in Memory".]]
  },
  Item_69872_Name = {
    Text = "Permanent Madness Formula"
  },
  Item_69873_Desc = {
    Text = [[
A special prescription from Clementine's Mental Clinic, capable of treating temporary psychological trauma.
Available for a limited time during "Buried in Memory".]]
  },
  Item_69873_Name = {
    Text = "Temporary Madness Prescription"
  },
  Item_69874_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The surging tides of the deep sea strike the boundaries of consciousness.
The ritual used to resist the erosion of alien dreams is available as a limited-time offer during the "Abyss Sacrifice".]]
  },
  Item_69874_Name = {
    Text = "Tide Erosion Defense Rite"
  },
  Item_69875_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The birth of the Sovereign slumbering in the darkest depths will distort the entire Mindsea.
The ritual designed to resist the erosion of foreign dreams will be available during the "Abyss Sacrifice" limited-time event.]]
  },
  Item_69875_Name = {
    Text = "Divine Celebration Rite"
  },
  Item_69876_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The Cataclysm in the Dreamscape also interferes with the Keeper's Luminis through spiritual resonance.
Rituals used to resist Dreamscape Corrosion will be available as a limited-time offer during the "Abyss Sacrifice".]]
  },
  Item_69876_Name = {
    Text = "Catastrophe Alert Rite"
  },
  Item_69877_Desc = {
    Text = [[
A nautical chart marked with a hidden route, leading to a small island where one can find rest.
Available for a limited time during "Beneath the Tempest".]]
  },
  Item_69877_Name = {
    Text = "Sanctuary in the Azure Sea"
  },
  Item_69885_Desc = {
    Text = "Exquisite and intricate doll components shimmer with the radiance of technology and Madness."
  },
  Item_69885_Name = {
    Text = "Refined Doll Parts"
  },
  Item_69889_Desc = {
    Text = "A bronze box sealed with incantations, containing tribute-grade supplies. It has already undergone a basic Awaken ritual and poses no danger to the opener.\nThat place was too impoverished; even the best offerings could only reach this level.—Kathigu-Ra"
  },
  Item_69889_Name = {
    Text = "Bronze \"Gift\""
  },
  Item_69890_Desc = {
    Text = "A massive chest emanating Abyssal aura, with deep red mist swirling around it. It contains a vast amount of supplies, but please be sure to notify professionals for assistance when opening it.\nDon't be so tense, I've already cleared the danger on top; I just retained this visual effect so you'd know where it came from.—Kathigu-Ra"
  },
  Item_69890_Name = {
    Text = "Bloodied \"Gift\""
  },
  Item_69891_Desc = {
    Text = "A container shimmering with golden light, with liquid gold endlessly flowing along its edges, holds precious offerings inside.\nTo be honest, I think this box is more valuable than its contents. Material possessions can only offer limited help to you, right?— Kathigu-Ra"
  },
  Item_69891_Name = {
    Text = "Golden \"Gift\""
  },
  Item_69892_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Never question the All-Father, "The Elements" and your doctor's prescription.
A good recipe for ensuring the Keeper's physical and mental health, available for a limited time during "Manifold Healing".]]
  },
  Item_69892_Name = {
    Text = "Recovery Treatment"
  },
  Item_69893_Desc = {
    Text = [[
What if one course of treatment has no effect? Then let's have another course! 
 A good remedy to ensure the Keeper's mental and physical health, supplied temporarily during "Manifold Healing".]]
  },
  Item_69893_Name = {
    Text = "Consolidation Treatment"
  },
  Item_69894_Desc = {
    Text = [[
What if I accidentally develop multiple personalities? Don't worry, Mythag has already prepared!
A good recipe to ensure the Keeper's mental and physical health is temporarily available during "Manifold Healing".]]
  },
  Item_69894_Name = {
    Text = "Acute Symptoms Treatment"
  },
  Item_69895_Desc = {
    Text = [[
A nautical chart depicting ancient sea routes, said to mark the location of a legendary treasure.
Available for a limited time during "Beneath the Tempest".]]
  },
  Item_69895_Name = {
    Text = "Treasures Hidden in Abyss"
  },
  Item_69896_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The banquet dish from the Ossuary Palace of Necrovia, the main course personally prepared by the King of the Ghouls, the coveted desire of every diner.
Available for a limited time during "Necrotic Aesthetics".]]
  },
  Item_69896_Name = {
    Text = "Soulsfeast Main Course"
  },
  Item_69897_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The banquet dishes of the Ossuary Palace in Necrovia, with all soups crafted from carefully selected ingredients.
Available for a limited time during "Necrotic Aesthetics".]]
  },
  Item_69897_Name = {
    Text = "Soulsfeast Thick Soup"
  },
  Item_69898_Desc = {
    Text = [[
The banquet dishes at the Ossuary Palace of Necrovia are meticulously crafted, even the appetizers are made with great care.
Available for a limited time during "Necrotic Aesthetics".]]
  },
  Item_69898_Name = {
    Text = "Soulsfeast Appetizer"
  },
  Item_69899_Desc = {
    Text = "The story begins with a magical silver film going missing—a mystery tale of a girl and her master.\nAvailable for a limited time during \"The Magic of Stories\"."
  },
  Item_69899_Name = {
    Text = "Mystery Story Film"
  },
  Item_69900_Desc = {
    Text = "An interlude in the story, a bumbling amateur actor takes the stage—a comedic tale of a girl and a phantom thief.\nAvailable for a limited time during \"The Magic of Stories\"."
  },
  Item_69900_Name = {
    Text = "Comedy Story Film"
  },
  Item_69901_Desc = {
    Text = "The story draws to a close, the silhouettes of companions against the sunset captured in a scrapbook—a fantastical tale of a girl and a whale.\nAvailable for a limited time during \"The Magic of Stories\"."
  },
  Item_69901_Name = {
    Text = "Film Strips of Fantasy"
  },
  Item_69902_Desc = {
    Text = "Corroded in some unknown manner, what appeared to be rusted metal wounds on the broken doll parts ooze black pus and blood."
  },
  Item_69902_Name = {
    Text = "Rusty Doll Parts"
  },
  Item_69985_Desc = {
    Text = "The Door opens to bring it closer to the primal Power—none fear Him not, and none yearn for Him not.\nA mysterious core from the Black Pool beneath Mythag, tempered by the power beyond the Door, drawing ever nearer to the primal essence, aiding Awakeners in ascending to unfathomable heights."
  },
  Item_69985_Name = {
    Text = "Refined Gnosis Primer"
  },
  Item_69986_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Fragments scattered in the Black Pool, awaiting the moment when the power of the Source is born under the illumination of the Infinite Door.
Mysterious fragments from the depths of Mythag, tempered by the power beyond the Door. Can be synthesized into Refined Gnosis Primer.]]
  },
  Item_69986_Name = {
    Text = "Refined Gnosis Fragment"
  },
