  Item_88873_Desc = {
    Text = "After recording this Posse, you can select the Posse Skill: \"Derision of Destiny\".\nThey always grasped for hope a moment too late.\nOnce, that tiny hand had guided him—sprinting together toward freedom's glow.\nNow, as he beat his wings in desperation, fighting against fate once more...\nWhy did that same hand tear through his chest?"
  },
  Item_88873_Name = {
    Text = "Derision of Destiny"
  },
  Item_88873_StoryDesc = {
    Text = [[
They always brush past fleeting hopes at the wrong time.
Once, that tender hand guided him towards the light of freedom.
As he desperately flapped his wings and broke free from the prison of fate once more, why did that familiar hand pierce through his chest at this moment?]]
  },
